            "notes": "This build has really terrible economy. Because it pours all of your resources into damage mitigation, you won't have that much point-wise.  However, you will be excellent at enabling your team. If you notice someone on your team that is being bullied or you have an aggressive flank comp, this build excels in making your team's MVPs unkillable.\n\nTry to play safer than you would usually play Zarya, **especially** in the early game. You can't bubble people if you are dead.\n\nThere aren't really any alternative powers to start off as [Lifelift](item_641c3e2b-d652-4dc6-9ab9-1e5307b78325) is a must-have. In terms of items you could really buy whatever you want.",
