            "notes": "The next power for this build is [Containment Shield](item_0406217c-a6af-4a19-8c7d-052c4d402848). If you were previously struggling to keep you or your team alive up to this point this should help with repositioning and relieving some pressure from your supports.\n\nTry to purchase [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98). It adds an addition 10% [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) and will give you a decent amount of points just from the healing you will do to yourself. If you have to sell [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) to afford it that is alright.\n\nSimilar to last round, if you notice the enemy team is more [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) focused and their builds are starting to reflect that (or if you had to sell [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0)), it could be worth buying [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214). It is a really cheap rare item that can give a lot of value.\n\n**If there is an [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) Ashe** and their powers are for her [Dynamite](ability_036f1090-38a3-408b-a322-d0edcd17ccf7) ability, you should absolutely buy [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f).",
