            "notes": "[Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) for maximum [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction).\n\nIf you have the money you can buy [Superconductor](item_6781242d-405f-44f8-ab3f-4a590551f531) if your [Particle Barrier](ability_30982993-037b-40a0-94af-227d3b77b290) is being destroyed every use or [R\u00fcstung von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) to not only be tankier but provide more healing through percent health healing from [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) and [Containment Shield](item_0406217c-a6af-4a19-8c7d-052c4d402848).\n\nWhatever you do, DO NOT buy [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4). It does not work with [Particle Barrier](ability_30982993-037b-40a0-94af-227d3b77b290) even though it heals due to the power.",
